Some of the instances listed below in which this Honble Court had imposed fine and cases charged against the petitioner;
d) The petitioner M.Abdulla approached this Hon'ble Court, in WP (MD) Nos. 4151 &
12648 of 2018, sought for direction to transfer the Deputy Director, Agricultural Department, Trichy, who had involved in Trichy V&AC Cr.No.2/2015, in which the Hon'ble High Court, Madurai Bench dismissed the writ petitions and imposed a heavy cost of Rs.1,00,000/-(Rs.50,000/- in each petition) on the petitioner for filling the writ petitions with malafide intention, for his personal gains.
